<title>ISRAEL: At least one Israeli killed in Gaza - sources.</title>
<headline>At least one Israeli killed in Gaza - sources.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least one Israeli was killed in clashes with Palestinians in the Gaza Strip on Thursday, Israeli security sources said.</p>
<p>They said a second Israeli was feared dead. Israel Radio, in an unsourced report, said two Israelis were killed. The army said it was checking the reports.</p>
</text>
